{"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["iOS","iPadOS","Mac Catalyst"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"playImmediately"},{"kind":"text","text":"()"}]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"play()","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" respects "},{"code":"automaticallyWaitsToMinimizeStalling","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":": the player keeps"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"rate at 0 while it re-evaluates whether playback can keep up, which costs"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"~half a second of frozen frame even on an item whose buffer is already"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"full. That re-evaluation buys nothing on a pre-warmed handoff — the item"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"was buffered on the warm-up player precisely so it can start instantly —"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"so the renderer uses this for warmed items only; cold loads keep "},{"code":"play()","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and its stall protection."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Protocol surface since the live resume needs it too: that path corrects content’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"position repeatedly behind the ad, and the hold re-engages on every correction, so"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"what costs half a second once costs a second per correction there."}]}]}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Start playback WITHOUT AVPlayer’s stall-minimization hold."}],"metadata":{"title":"playImmediately()","modules":[{"name":"OptiViewAdsRuntime"}],"symbolKind":"method","role":"symbol","roleHeading":"Instance Method","externalID